{"4901580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Staircore", "steam_appid": 4901580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Staircore has a final destination, but it is not a physical destination. The transitional phase between high and low has become thin, and I have fallen inbetween. Will I ever get out? After a runaway, this is where I am?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game description:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Staircore is a first person liminal exploration game. Traverse the Staircore to find different environments, cores and game modes. ~2 hours expected playtime.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Start the trial:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>A call everyday, a killer's call...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your trial is coming soon. Most probable: life in prison. Second: the ward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Psycho might be waiting... I know that you didn't do it! Have fun, defendant!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Necessary Intel:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The Nostalgia Demodulation Project is not compulsory, but recommended. Feeling nostalgia while in the presence of [REDACTED] results in a chemical reaction, [REDACTED].</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liminal Nostalgia Rehabilitation Program (LNRP); Sector A: If you feel nostalgia, turn back immediately.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get to know them:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chicken stair = Stairhead</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guy with axe = Psycho/Prosecutor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guy with phone = Defendant/Player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stairbear = Guardian of the backrooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are more to know, but not now...</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Staircore has a final destination, but it is not a physical destination. The transitional phase between high and low has become thin, and I have fallen inbetween. Will I ever get out? After a runaway, this is where I am?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game description:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Staircore is a first person liminal exploration game. Traverse the Staircore to find different environments, cores and game modes. ~2 hours expected playtime.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Start the trial:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>A call everyday, a killer's call...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your trial is coming soon. Most probable: life in prison. Second: the ward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Psycho might be waiting... I know that you didn't do it! Have fun, defendant!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Necessary Intel:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The Nostalgia Demodulation Project is not compulsory, but recommended. Feeling nostalgia while in the presence of [REDACTED] results in a chemical reaction, [REDACTED].</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liminal Nostalgia Rehabilitation Program (LNRP); Sector A: If you feel nostalgia, turn back immediately.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get to know them:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chicken stair = Stairhead</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guy with axe = Psycho/Prosecutor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guy with phone = Defendant/Player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stairbear = Guardian of the backrooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are more to know, but not now...</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "The staircore has a final destination, but it is not a physical destination. The transitional phase between high and low has become thin, and I have fallen inbetween. Will I ever get out?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4901580/ff2eb459276ee2e574926ca7748fa5a35bcde750/header.jpg?t=1785551674", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c